# feature-driven workflow (install.sh --workflow feature-driven). harness-tailor fills these in.
# Where the model, feature list, designs, and approvals live. Local, never committed: .agents/fdd
# (ignored by the seeded .gitignore), another repo dir with its own .gitignore ('*' and '!.gitignore';
# verify reports fdd-not-local without one), or an absolute path outside the repo.
FDD_DIR=".agents/fdd"
# What a private feature ID looks like (Python regex).
FDD_ID_PATTERN="F-[0-9]+"
# Changes here need a feature in progress (plan task set to doing) and its design (space-separated globs).
# Once features.md exists, verify reports fdd-scope-empty while this matches no file in the repo.
FDD_SCOPE="src/**"
# What a feature name looks like (Python regex); empty skips the check.
FDD_NAME_PATTERN="^\S+ .+ (by|for|of|to|from|in|on|with|into) .+$"
# Check-ins that need your approval (fdd approve): list design inspect. Others get an agent review only.
FDD_ASK="list design inspect"
